Package: app-hub
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Hafij-BGE <mdhafijur.rahman@ogr.deu.edu.tr>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, python3-apt, gir1.2-gtk-4.0 (>= 4.14), gir1.2-adw-1 (>= 1.5), pkexec | policykit-1, apt, dpkg
Recommends: polkitd
Suggests: snapd, flatpak
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/Hafij-DEU/Application-hub
Description: install, update and uninstall apps from any channel
 App Hub installs and updates Craft Suite, Markd, Draco Download Manager,
 DocScan, Extendo and Astra Player from their GitHub releases, with SHA-256 checks.
 .
 It also lists every installed desktop app (deb, snap, Flatpak, AppImage)
 with its channel, updates and uninstalls them, shows recently uninstalled
 apps with a reinstall button, installs local .deb files, keeps a list of
 favorite apps, asks Gemini where to get an app (answers are verified
 before install) and cleans leftovers of removed apps.
